@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Fix a crash when an invalid regular expression is provided for a ``*-rgx``
+or ``*-patterns`` option. Pylint now reports a readable error message instead
+of raising a ``re.error`` traceback.
+
+Closes #7228
diff --git a/pylint/config/argument.py b/pylint/config/argument.py
